# Proprietary blobs for the Meizu M5c (M710H), MT6737M.
#
# Generated by tools/proprietary-files.py from vendor/meizu/m5c; do not edit
# by hand. From device/meizu/m5c run:
#   tools/proprietary-files.py ../../../vendor/meizu/m5c > proprietary-files.txt
#
# Format: SRC:DST, SRC under vendor/meizu/m5c/proprietary/ (stock Flyme 6
# blobs), DST the path in the image. Everything lands on /vendor, except:
#   vendor/odm/etc     the .tp thermal tables, read as /odm/etc (no odm
#                      partition; thermal_manager is patched to that path);
#   system/etc/...     files the kernel opens by path with filp_open() (WMT,
#                      Wi-Fi, FM firmware and their config, slp_conf).
# The SPM PCM firmware (vendor/meizu/m5c/firmware/spm) is built from GPL
# source and not listed.
